  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The pressure exerted by a non-reactive gaseous mixture of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of methane and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of carbon dioxide in a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math> vessel at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is _____<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>kPa</mi><mo>.</mo></math> (Round off to the Nearest Integer).</p><p>[Assume gases are ideal,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;Atomic masses:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></math>]</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "150",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Total moles of gases,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>44</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>nRT</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>49652</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Pa</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>149</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>652</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kPa</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>150</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kPa</mi></math></p>",
